<title>UK: Norway's Oseberg to load equiv 44 cargoes in Dec.</title>
<headline>Norway's Oseberg to load equiv 44 cargoes in Dec.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Oseberg crude liftings in December are scheduled to total the equivalent of 44 standard 500,000-barrel cargoes, compared with 43 in the original November programme, traders said.  </p>
<p>December loadings should total 22 million barrels, compared with 21.5 million in November.</p>
<p>Traders expect the December programme to be made up of 20 cargoes of 600,000 barrels, 14 of 500,000 barrels and three of one million barrels.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
